      "writtenOn": "2025-08-29T01:34:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems problematic. The stuff we figure out in `RecordBuiltinCallMetadata` is presumably still important even for textures that come from `getBinding`. Dawn needs to know that information for each texture that it binds. But the indices aren\u0027t always constant, so we won\u0027t know here which texture the metadata corresponds to.\n\nI\u0027m not sure how we solve this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 670,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 674,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b6bec61c23b75a56317a1bf3a837ef4e753015e5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "89aa6c3c_d6e7604b",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.cc",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 674,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-29T01:48:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How does this work for `binding_array`? We just return the metadata for the whole binding array, and so Dawn applies that information to every single element?\n\nIf so, so we do the same here? Does that break stuff?\n(I\u0027m not particularly familiar with what Dawn does with all of this information, need to read up).",
      "parentUuid": "cdd0e8fc_14f54b78",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 670,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 674,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b6bec61c23b75a56317a1bf3a837ef4e753015e5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3b7c1fc3_b019a060",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.cc",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 674,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-29T02:02:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I discussed this with cwallez@ as I was working on it, from the Dawn side the preference was to not have this information come back as texture data. If Dawn decides they need it in here we can add it in later, but for now, the request was to skip resource_binding data.",
      "parentUuid": "89aa6c3c_d6e7604b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 670,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 674,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "b6bec61c23b75a56317a1bf3a837ef4e753015e5",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d3dcf365_9c719374",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.cc",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 674,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-29T07:52:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In we don\u0027t need it because this metadata is used in three inspector calls that are irrelevant for bindless:\n\n - [GetSamplerTextureUses]( https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.h;drc\u003d838cd911eec65e5379f4650f81dc7c45e77bc3da;l\u003d91) which is not use outside of Tint.\n - [GetSamplerAndNonSamplerTextureUses](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.h;drc\u003d838cd911eec65e5379f4650f81dc7c45e77bc3da;l\u003d99) unpacked into [samplerAndNonSamplerTexturePairs](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/ShaderModule.h;drc\u003db7338571b509ecbe3ce428ce1aac23e1143ade0c;l\u003d291) used only in the GL backend (which won\u0027t support bindless) and for computing the SampleType in [PipelineLayout defaulting](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/PipelineLayout.cpp;drc\u003d9a44a5027dd82f1bda410419dbbaa7b6066bed97;l\u003d398)\n - [GetTextureQueries](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/tint/lang/wgsl/inspector/inspector.h;drc\u003d838cd911eec65e5379f4650f81dc7c45e77bc3da;l\u003d144) which is only used for emulation in the GL backend (which won\u0027t support bindless).\n \nOf note: in the future we\u0027ll need to add `texture_2d\u003cunfilterable, f32\u003e` of sorts with some matching in Tint. This is because right now it is Dawn that requires in the layout that the texture sample type matches \"float\" or \"unfilterable-float\" but with bindless that will need to be changed to be a runtime type check.",
      "parentUuid": "3b7c1fc3_b019a060",
